# Local dev secrets for Edge Functions (loaded automatically by
# `supabase functions serve`). Copy to `.env` in this same directory —
# `.env` here is already covered by the repo's root .gitignore, but
# double-check with `git check-ignore -v supabase/functions/.env`
# before your first commit with it in place.
#
# This is an Edge Function secret, not Supabase Vault — see
# docs/DEPLOY.md for the distinction and for how to set the prod
# equivalent via `supabase secrets set`.

GEMINI_API_KEY=your-ai-studio-key-here
